        {
          "cardinality": "at most 1",
          "definition": "The stops in running order, from one terminus to the other. Not filled in the facts: a `list of` value in a fact is emitted as one plain triple per stop, not as an rdf:List, and then fails sh:maxCount 1 (rust/BUGS.md, mountain-ultra A). `serves` lists the stops in running order instead.",
